{
  "bodyHash": "404942817c863258",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Tanuki Decor</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组添加了200多种方块，涵盖时钟、座椅和床，以及储物柜、灯具和装饰品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>自定义合成</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">家具通过“自定义工作台”制作。将圆石、原木、陶球和铁锭放入自定义工作台中，然后选择要合成的物品。自定义配方可在配置文件中禁用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/diy_workbench_gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"499\" height=\"280\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>时钟</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">内置30多种时钟，拥有迷人的纹理和独特的音效。许多时钟会在正午、午夜或黎明时分报时。最重要的是，它们显示的时间非常准确！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/grandfather_clock.png\" width=\"61\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_clock_tower_dial.png\" width=\"93\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/owl_clock.png\" width=\"49\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/green_clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/red_clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>座椅</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">享受20多种座椅选择，从凳子到椅子再到沙发应有尽有。终于可以在辛苦挖矿和合成一天后，回到家中翘起二郎腿，好好放松一下了。部分座椅可同时容纳两名玩家！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/sweets_sofa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cabana_chair.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gorgeous_seat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"88\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/wooden_block_chair.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>床铺</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">厌倦了那些小巧且颜色刺眼的原版床？受够了和村民挤在一起睡觉？全新推出10多种主题床铺，包括双人床和四柱床。柔软舒适的枕头*始终*配备！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/green_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/antique_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gorgeous_bed.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"160\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/wooden_block_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>储物</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tanuki Decor 增加了30多种储物方块，从床头梳妆台到2x2的大衣柜应有尽有。大多数方块都能提供相当于双层箱子的存储空间。选择最适合你家风格的一款，告别那些丑陋的箱子和木桶吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/antique_cabinet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"121\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/blue_wardrobe.png\" width=\"88\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/minimalist_dresser.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cabana_vanity.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>照明</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">既然可以拥有台灯、壁炉甚至霓虹灯牌，谁还需要火把呢？用十几种温馨的照明选项来升级你的家园吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/minimalist_lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_fireplace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/egyptian_lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/regal_wall_lamp.png\" width=\"95\" height=\"80\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>家具系列</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">从10个不同系列中挑选品味不凡的家具，尽情展现你的个性。集齐整套吧！</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">古董系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/antique_series.png\" alt=\"古董系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蓝色系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/blue_series.png\" alt=\"蓝色系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">度假小屋系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/cabana_series.png\" alt=\"度假小屋系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">埃及系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/egyptian_series.png\" alt=\"埃及系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">华丽系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/gorgeous_series.png\" alt=\"华丽系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">绿色系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/green_series.png\" alt=\"绿色系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">实验室系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/lab_series.png\" alt=\"实验室系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">极简系列</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/minimalist_series.png\" alt=\"极简系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/mushroom_series.png\" alt=\"蘑菇系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">皇家系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/regal_series.png\" alt=\"皇家系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">甜点系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/sweets_series.png\" alt=\"甜点系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">木块系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/wooden_block_series.png\" alt=\"木块系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>装饰</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组中还额外添加了60多种装饰方块，包括各种尺寸的桌子、各式花瓶、彩色拉花以及其他点缀装饰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gumball_machine.png\" width=\"55\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/ship_in_a_bottle.png\" width=\"77\" height=\"80\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/blue_table.png\" width=\"136\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/sweets_mini_table.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/stall_tarp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分方块不仅颜值高，还具备额外的实用功能！详情请见下文。</span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鸟笼</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有鹦鹉吗？想把它妥善保管起来？鸟笼正是为此设计！当鹦鹉站在你肩膀上时，右键点击鸟笼即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/birdcage.png\" alt=\"Birdcage\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/elegant_birdcage.png\" alt=\"Elegant Birdcage\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">收银机</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活后播放清脆悦耳的“叮”声。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cash_register.png\" alt=\"Cash Register\" width=\"121\" height=\"133\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">展示柜</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用一两个精致的展示柜来炫耀你的宝藏吧。它同样支持显示自定义名称。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/display_case.png\" alt=\"Display Case\" width=\"156\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/long_display_case.png\" alt=\"Long Display Case\" width=\"176\" height=\"206\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地球仪</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活后随机旋转。停止旋转后，该地球仪会根据其朝向输出比较器信号。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/globe.png\" alt=\"Globe\" width=\"104\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手推车</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">存放杂物既实用又美观的方式</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/handcart.png\" alt=\"Handcart\" width=\"106\" height=\"87\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙漏</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活后启动30秒计时器，比较器输出每2秒变化一次。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/hourglass.png\" alt=\"Hourglass\" width=\"113\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷你玩偶</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活后播放挤压毛绒玩具的吱吱声。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/mayoral_mini_figure.png\" alt=\"Mayoral Mini Figure\" width=\"123\" height=\"126\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">节拍器</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活可调节滴答速度或将其关闭。共7档速度设置。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/metronome.png\" alt=\"Metronome\" width=\"88\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牛顿摆</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以开关设备。在下方放置羊毛块可消音。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/newtons_cradle.png\" alt=\"Newtons Cradle\" width=\"119\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留声机</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">堪称唱片机2.0！悠闲地坐着，看着唱片旋转，聆听你最爱的黑胶音乐。对原版唱片碟片的支持方式与1.20及更高版本的唱片机相同，均支持漏斗操作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/phonograph.png\" alt=\"Phonograph\" width=\"129\" height=\"179\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">钢琴</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活可演奏随机音符。若钢琴下方有音符盒，则会改为演奏该音符盒的声音。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/piano.png\" alt=\"Piano\" width=\"168\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">等离子球</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">激活以开关设备。哇，光线扭动得好有趣！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/plasma_ball.gif\" alt=\"Plasma Ball\" width=\"195\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火箭灯</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">好吧，这个没有特殊用途。我只是想展示一下动画效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/rocket_lamp.gif\" alt=\"Rocket Lamp\" width=\"195\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">科学舱</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在这些充满气泡感的科幻舱内展示特殊物品，释放你内心的疯狂科学家潜能吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/science_pod.png\" alt=\"Science Pod\" width=\"90\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">老虎机</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">觉得自己运气不错吗？来转一把试试。机器运转期间比较器输出为1，中奖（大奖）时输出为15。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/slot_machine.png\" alt=\"Slot Machine\" width=\"90\" height=\"192\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火车模型</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欣赏小火车在无尽循环中嘟嘟前进的乐趣。可在铁轨下方放置羊毛块以静音音效。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/train_set.png\" alt=\"Train Set\" width=\"192\" height=\"94\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">花瓶</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这些陶瓷罐虽只能存放一组物品，但至少颜值在线！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/classic_vase.png\" alt=\"Classic Vase\" width=\"76\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"Fancy Vase\" width=\"76\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"Large Fancy Vase\" width=\"101\" height=\"160\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_striped_vase.png\" alt=\"Large Striped Vase\" width=\"120\" height=\"140\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/small_fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"Small Fancy Vase\" width=\"53\" height=\"56\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/small_striped_vase.png\" alt=\"Small Striped Vase\" width=\"69\" height=\"56\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置说明</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可通过将单个物品和配方添加至“tanukidecor:diy_blacklist”物品标签来禁用它们。<br>有关更多选项，请参阅配置文件“tanukidecor-common.cfg”。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致谢</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/skyjay1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">skyjay1</a> - 代码编写与维护<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tobcs123/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thatonebrasschronoshinx</a> - 创意、项目管理与音效设计<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/skart/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skart2000</a> - 模型与美术<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crabmods/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CrabMods</a> - NeoForge 1.21.1 移植</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>常见问题</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问</strong>：支持 Forge 还是 Fabric？<br><strong>答</strong>：仅支持 Forge / NeoForge。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问</strong>：我可以在整合包中使用此模组吗？<br><strong>答</strong>：可以。请链接至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tanukidecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 页面</a>，请勿直接重新分发模组文件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问</strong>：你有 Discord 服务器吗？<br><strong>答</strong>：你可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.tophatcat.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">MMD 服务器</a> 的 <span style=\"color:#36f\">#skyjay-mods</span> 频道（位于“社区模组”板块下）找到我。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问</strong>：我有一个建议！<br><strong>答</strong>：太棒了！请在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tanukidecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge 页面</a> 留言，或在 <a href=\"https://github.com/skyjay1/Tanuki-Decor/issues/2\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交“建议”议题。</span></p>",
